  "interpretation_boundary": "These are independent, host-PDC-compensated exports of one installed Pro-DS VST3 instance over a 72-second composite arrangement. The evidence isolates one installed version, one default threshold/range, Single Vocal detection, Wide versus Split processing, Lookahead enabled versus disabled, and host-reported latency. The steady multitone is deliberately non-speech and tests false or absent triggering rather than de-essing quality. The early and late source events are deterministic fixture excerpts, not an annotated phoneme corpus. Results therefore do not establish recall/precision across singers, languages or consonant classes; external sidechain, Allround mode, alternate thresholds/ranges, automation, CPU use, and listening preference remain outside this test."
